Fonts embedded by lumigift-studio (see docs/UI_DESIGN.md §7.2-7.3).

Inter 4.1 (OFL-1.1)        Inter-{Regular,Medium,SemiBold}.ttf from Inter-4.1.zip extras/ttf/
Inter Tnum (OFL-1.1)       derived, tabular figures frozen in:
    pyftfeatfreeze -f tnum -S -U Tnum Inter-Regular.ttf InterTnum-Regular.ttf
    pyftfeatfreeze -f tnum -S -U Tnum Inter-Medium.ttf  InterTnum-Medium.ttf
Geist Mono 1.9.0 (OFL-1.1) GeistMono-{Regular,Medium}.ttf from geist-font-v1.9.0.zip GeistMono/ttf/
Phosphor 2.1.2 (MIT)       @phosphor-icons/web src/{regular/Phosphor.ttf,fill/Phosphor-Fill.ttf},
                           subset to the codepoints listed in phosphor-icons.txt (name + hex codepoint,
                           looked up in src/regular/style.css). Subsetting is mandatory: the stock font
                           maps a-z/space/hyphen for ligatures and would hijack Latin text.
    U=$(awk '{printf "U+%s,", toupper($2)}' phosphor-icons.txt | sed 's/,$//')
    pyftsubset Phosphor.ttf      --unicodes="$U" --layout-features='' --no-hinting --output-file=Phosphor.ttf
    pyftsubset Phosphor-Fill.ttf --unicodes="$U" --layout-features='' --no-hinting --output-file=Phosphor-Fill.ttf
To add an icon: append "name codepoint" to phosphor-icons.txt, re-run the subset, add a const in src/icons.rs.
